 Question Papers\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.1rem\",\"color\":\"var(--text-muted)\",\"marginBottom\":\"40px\"},\"children\":\"Download official previous year question papers for various Chhattisgarh government exams.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card\",\"style\":{\"marginBottom\":\"30px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.5rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"20px\",\"borderBottom\":\"2px solid var(--border-color)\",\"paddingBottom\":\"10px\"},\"children\":\"Question Papers of Recruitment Exams 2024\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"style\":{\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"padding\":0,\"margin\":0},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/0cd6b532-4cc9-42a0-8639-648565033932.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 प्रयोगशाला सहायक भर्ती परीक्षा 2023 (KASL23)\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/b5efbb7a-e9ed-4cb0-a85a-47f6e01fe083.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 आदिम जाति तथा अनुसूचित जाति विकास, नवा रायपुर, (छ.ग.) के अंतर्गत छात्रावास अधीक्षक श्रेणी “द” भर्ती परीक्षा (THS24)\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"color\":\"var(--text-main)\",\"marginBottom\":\"8px\"},\"children\":\"राज्य न्यायालयिक विज्ञान प्रयोगशाला, रायपुर (छ.ग.) के अंतर्गत प्रयोगशाला सहायक एवं प्रयोगशाला तकनीशियन भर्ती परीक्षा (FDLT24) :\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"display\":\"flex\",\"gap\":\"15px\",\"paddingLeft\":\"15px\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/0f6e7980-0788-4905-81e8-8294096e3d5c.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 प्रयोगशाला सहायक\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/14c87b8b-4aa1-4897-a687-a24d97e2f004_47_202084-OK-ZMZS-SH-M_A.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 Paper 2\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/86d44290-4388-4c29-b021-d706e4c2b078.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 प्रयोगशाला तकनीशियन\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card\",\"style\":{\"marginBottom\":\"30px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.5rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"20px\",\"borderBottom\":\"2px solid var(--border-color)\",\"paddingBottom\":\"10px\"},\"children\":\"Question Papers of Recruitment Exams 2023\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"style\":{\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"padding\":0,\"margin\":0},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/40704015-3e18-4f64-8128-aacd4a15f0a4.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 छत्तीसगढ़ उच्च न्यायालय, बिलासपुर के अंतर्गत सहायक ग्रेड-3 पद हेतु प्रथम स्तर की लिखित परीक्षा\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"color\":\"var(--text-main)\",\"marginBottom\":\"8px\"},\"children\":\"छत्तीसगढ़ स्टेट पॉवर ट्रांसमिशन कंपनी लिमिटेड के अंतर्गत सहायक अभियंता (इलेक्ट्रिकल) एवं कनिष्ठ अभियंता (इलेक्ट्रिकल / मैकेनिकल / सिविल / इलेक्ट्रॉनिक्स) भर्ती परीक्षा (EBJE23) - 2023\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"display\":\"flex\",\"gap\":\"15px\",\"paddingLeft\":\"15px\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/2b6ec1f0-a2c7-4dc6-adea-dfe9c53c5a87.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 CIVIL\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/0c77d2bd-62b1-48bf-b81e-40bca13a5943.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 MECHNICAL\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/9c3e6372-7900-43d1-a82a-1dcb6618fe46.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 ELECTRICAL\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/f7429b6a-3151-4b3c-b1e0-7e4be67a80a2.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 ELECTRONICS\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/eb995072-df64-4d5e-ba0e-a130c772eb98.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 छ.ग. राज्य कृषि विपणन (मण्डी) बोर्ड, रायपुर के अंतर्गत सहायक संचालक, सचिव वरिष्ठ, सचिव कनिष्ठ भर्ती परीक्षा (MBD23)\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"color\":\"var(--text-main)\",\"marginBottom\":\"8px\"},\"children\":\"संचालनालय कृषि, छत्तीसगढ़, नवा रायपुर के अंतर्गत (Morning) सर्वेयर एवं अनुरेखक(Evening) भर्ती परीक्षा (KST23)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"display\":\"flex\",\"gap\":\"15px\",\"paddingLeft\":\"15px\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/3f2c1684-6d54-4d63-b02a-cff3b06b1a31.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 Morning\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/2385d2ed-c221-4a96-85ce-220416c278e7.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 Evening\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/f34a515d-a2c0-4fd5-a156-fde3421284cb.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 संचालनालय कृषि, छत्तीसगढ़, नवा रायपुर के अंतर्गत ग्रागीण कृषि विस्तार अधिकारी भर्ती परीक्षा (RAEO23)\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"color\":\"var(--text-main)\",\"marginBottom\":\"8px\"},\"children\":\"अपेक्स बैंक और जिला केंद्रीय सहकारी बैंक भर्ती परीक्षा (CBAS23) - 2023\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"display\":\"flex\",\"gap\":\"15px\",\"paddingLeft\":\"15px\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapam.cgstate.gov.in/sites/default/files/2023-10/57_203102-UJYR-SP-REC-M_A.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 Main Document\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/fbda13b4-ada5-42ce-a45d-fb5ceaf3f682.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 Morning Shift\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/83158817-5d14-4c91-838a-dd68513564e7.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 Evening Shift\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/717b3201-257c-4d49-b0ae-f575df0a1d07.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 लोक स्वास्थ्य यांत्रिकी विभाग, नवा रायपुर के अंतर्गत हैण्डपंप तकनीशियन भर्ती परीक्षा 2023 (PHEH23)\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"color\":\"var(--text-main)\",\"marginBottom\":\"8px\"},\"children\":\"संचालनालय महिला एवं बाल विकास विभाग, छत्तीसगढ़ के अंतर्गत पर्यवेक्षक (खुली सीधी भर्ती) एवं पर्यवेक्षक (परिसीमित सीधी भर्ती ) परीक्षा 2023\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"display\":\"flex\",\"gap\":\"15px\",\"paddingLeft\":\"15px\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/b2f563fa-af17-42ff-a63f-9e7a7dce1eb9.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 खुली सीधी भर्ती\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/13b47aa6-4520-465e-a63c-8a81eea79c6f.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 परिसीमित सीधी भर्ती\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/44d55548-0369-4fe2-8c42-7bb532deb82b.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 संचालनालय रोजगार एवं प्रशिक्षण (प्रशिक्षण पक्ष), नवा रायपुर के अंतर्गत छात्रावास अधीक्षक एवं छात्रावास अधीक्षिका भर्ती परीक्षा (ITIH23) - 2023\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/uploads/pdfs/471a7289-6d54-49e6-8e99-248cb8a8af5b.pdf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\"},\"children\":\"📄 कार्यालय श्रमायुक्त, छत्तीसगढ़ के अंर्तगत सहायक श्रम पदाधिकारी, श्रम निरीक्षक एवं श्रम उपनिरीक्षक भर्ती परीक्षा (LOI23)-2023\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"15px 0\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vyapamcg.cgstate.gov.in/Post?PostID=ITIRQUE2023\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--color-primary)\"